src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FwVn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png" width="1456" height="693" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:693,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:229981,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://notesfromzero.substack.com/i/183295928?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FwVn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FwVn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FwVn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FwVn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc9189d72-3c8a-4c8d-a1bc-ec1bdc643129_1972x938.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" style="height:20px;width:20px" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The current version of the YouTube summariser is 0.3.0 (https://github.com/weijianzhg/youtube-summariser/releases/tag/v0.3.0). I also upgraded the default LLMs, so it&#8217;s now using the latest GPT-5.2 and Claude Sonnet 4.5 by default. Both have a pretty large input token space, and overall they&#8217;re very, very powerful.</p><p></p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Simplifying the YouTube Summariser: Command-Line First, with Streaming Next]]></title><description><![CDATA[We need to simplify!]]></description><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/simplifying-the-youtube-summariser</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 22:19:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>We need to simplify! Right now the youtube summariser tool (https://github.com/weijianzhg/youtube-summariser) offering both a web UI and a command-line option which feels a bit cumbersome. If we just focus on the command line tooling and make it really easy to use, that&#8217;s probably more beneficial. </p><p>If it&#8217;s only a command-line tool, I can package it as a Python package and publish it on PyPI, so other people can easily use it. I think that would bring more value to the tooling overall.</p><p>That&#8217;s what I did. You can find it here: https://pypi.org/project/youtube-summariser/</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png" width="644" height="364.5632183908046" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:788,&quot;width&quot;:1392,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:644,&quot;bytes&quot;:119702,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://notesfromzero.substack.com/i/183184537?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h3CG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3013ca8f-6fe7-408e-80cc-ee53911e0012_1392x788.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg role="img" style="height:20px;width:20px" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><title></title><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Another thing is streaming. For larger inputs, like a YouTube video that&#8217;s several hours long, users probably won&#8217;t want to wait for the entire output to finish. It&#8217;d be better to stream the results as they&#8217;re generated and keep the connection alive the whole time. I will do this next.</p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Reviving a YouTube Summariser with CLI Support and Model Upgrades]]></title><description><![CDATA[I want to take a pretty simple idea from a project I did about nine months ago.]]></description><link>https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://notesfromzero.substack.com/p/reviving-a-youtube-summariser-with</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Weijian Zhang]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 23:00:45 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I want to take a pretty simple idea from a project I did about nine months ago. It&#8217;s a YouTube summariser I built mostly through vibe coding, and I haven&#8217;t touched the codebase since &#8212; it&#8217;s just been sitting on GitHub at: https://github.com/weijianzhg/youtube-summariser (MIT Licensed)</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-75b3a47ee648_1378x912.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Qm_O!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9f99c911-3507-437e-98b4-